# Getting Started

This example configures the provider and creates a tag.

```hcl
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.11"

  required_providers {
    crosswork = {
      source = "CiscoDevNet/crosswork"
    }
  }
}

provider "crosswork" {
  username = "admin"
  password = "password"
  url      = "https://10.1.1.1"
}

resource "crosswork_tags" "example" {
  name     = "example"
  category = "example"
}
```

The credentials and URL can also be set with the `CW_USERNAME`, `CW_PASSWORD` and `CW_URL` environment variables.

Run `terraform init`, `terraform plan` and `terraform apply` to create the tag.
